# Architecture

Canonical: `docs/ENGINEERING_STANDARD.md` ·
`docs/process/ENGINEERING_PRINCIPLES.md` · `docs/architecture/` · `docs/adr/`

## Always

- Feature-first Clean Architecture: UI → State → Domain → Data.
- Riverpod Notifier / AsyncNotifier / AsyncValue (no legacy StateNotifier).
- UI never calls CLI / SDK / HTTP directly; repositories own I/O.
- DTOs map to domain models before UI.
- Prefer `features/providers/core/` and `features/providers/copilot/`
  (ADR-004); do not expand legacy aliases.
- Capability-driven shared UI via `ProviderRegistry`.
- Never invent usage values; label stale / LKG data.
- No `/copilot_internal`, undocumented APIs, or scraping.
- No Cursor personal quota provider (PD-023).
- No Flutter Web tray playground (PD-025).
- Targeted cleanup over rewrites (ADR-004 / PD-024).

## When architecture changes

Create or update an ADR under `docs/adr/` and cross-link
`docs/project/DECISION_LOG.md` before considering the work complete.
